    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Loyalty Steward.</strong> Your work doesn’t just win moments; it sticks.</p><ul><li>When you succeed at a major Diplomacy check, Courtly Intrigue, or equivalent social operation that resolves a conflict tied to a specific hex (such as ending an uprising, brokering a pact, or incorporating a new ally), you may choose that hex. <strong>Loyalty in the chosen hex increases by 1</strong>, up to the maximum the GM allows for the current campaign state.</li><li>This effect can apply once per such operation and requires your visible or known involvement.</li></ul>",
